  "duration_s": 425.367007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们国家面积一平方公里以上的天然湖泊有将近两千七百个。可要说哪一座最值得去那争议可就大了。有人说是西湖人间天堂，有人说是千岛湖，天下第一，秀水错。真要论起值得两个字，西湖和千岛湖连前三都进不去。今天咱们就来盘点中国最值得去剧的十大湖。先讲第十到第六，一个比一个绝。老规矩开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看这湖谁在听。平十名青海茶卡盐湖在青海海西州乌兰县湖面海拔三千零五十九米，总面积一百零五平方公里。这湖最绝的是它平平的向一面镜子，湖面上铺着一层薄薄的盐水，天是什么颜色，湖就是什么颜色，云是什么形状，湖里就倒映什么形状。人走在湖面上，就像走在云上，所以叫天空之境。白天是天空之境，晚上是夜空之静，银河倒映在湖面上，星星在脚下，茶卡盐湖的盐挖了三千多年。早在西汉时期，当地的羌人就在这儿采盐。这里的岩层最厚的地方有十几米，够全世界人吃上好几十年。您坐着小火车往湖心走，两边全是白花花的盐，脚下踩的是盐水，里泡的是盐，连空气里都飘着咸味儿。您说这是湖还是老天爷搁在地上的一面镜子？第九名，云南洱海在云南大理苍山脚下，这湖最绝的不是水，是水边那条路。洱海生态廊道全长一百二十九公里，一边是青瓦白墙的白族民居，一边是碧蓝的湖水，海菜花在水面上开着，白花白鹭在浅滩上站着，您骑着自行车慢慢走，风吹过来，湖面闪着光。洱海的鸟类从九十四种增加到了一百零四种，海菜花分布面积达到约七十六万平方米。这些树字什么意思？说明洱海的水越来越干净了。洱海边上还有个古生村，村里有棵大青树，一千多年了，树下是青石板路，路边是白族老院子，您走累了，往湖边一坐村苍边上十九封看洱海万顷波，看天上的云慢慢走。您说这是湖还是大自然？给人类发的一张成绩单。第八名，浙江千岛湖在浙江杭州淳安这壶，最绝的是他水底下压着两座古城。一九五九年，新安江水电站蓄水狮城和鹤城两座千年古城沉到了水底下。千岛湖的水质，常年保持地表水一类标准，能见度七米以上。湖面上有一千零七十八座岛，每一座岛都是原来的一座山头。您坐船在湖上走底下，就是一座沉在水底的古城。千岛湖底下那两座城城墙还在，牌坊还在民房还在连城门口的石狮子都还蹲在那儿水下考古队下去看过，说保存的比预想的好得多。因为水温低，水流慢，木头、石头都没怎么烂。您说这是湖还是一座泡在水里的博物馆？第七名，云南抚仙湖在云南玉溪澄江这壶醉绝的是他身平均深度九十多米，最深处一百五十多米，蓄水量两百零六亿立方米，占云南全省湖泊蓄水总量的六成以上。什么概念？滇池和洱海加起来还不到他的一半。更邪乎的是，湖底下发现了一座古城，有石板路，有建筑机制。有人说是古滇国的都城，到现在没人能说清他是什么时候沉下去。抚仙湖的水清的能看见水底的石头，古人管它叫琉璃万顷抚仙湖还有个奇怪的地方，湖里捞上来过不少青铜器，有铜鼓，有铜，釜有铜毛。跟中原的青铜器长得完全不一样，跟古滇国的青铜器倒是像一家人，您说这是壶，还是一个藏着秘密的深渊？第六名，新疆塞里木湖在新疆博尔塔拉天山山脉西段，湖面海拔两千零七十一米，是新疆海拔最高、面积最大的高山湖泊。这湖最绝的是它的蓝大西洋的暖石气流从欧洲出发，走了六千多公里，翻过天山，最后在塞里木湖上空化作一场雨落了下来，所以叫大西洋最后一滴眼泪。赛里木湖最大水深超过九十米，透明度高达十二米。阳光照进去，湖水把阳光拆开，只把最难的那一层流在水面。您站在湖边看，蓝的不像真的。赛里木湖的兰不是一种难，早上是浅浅的蓝，中午是深深的懒，傍晚是带紫的蓝，当地人管他叫赛里木兰，全世界找不出第二个，您说这是湖还是大西洋？哭了一滴泪。从第十到第六，茶卡盐湖是一面镜子，洱海是一张成绩单。千岛湖是一座泡在水里的博物馆，抚仙湖是一个藏着秘密的深渊，赛里木湖是大西洋的一滴眼泪，可这五个还不是最值得去的。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个狠，有一个湖会变好几种颜色有一个湖养活了一整个高原，他是哪个？他凭什么排第一，下季马上更新。您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 890,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 990,
      "end_ms": 7330,
      "text": "咱们国家面积一平方公里以上的天然湖泊有将近两千七百个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7890,
      "end_ms": 11470,
      "text": "可要说哪一座最值得去那争议可就大了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11790,
      "end_ms": 14810,
      "text": "有人说是西湖人间天堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15070,
      "end_ms": 16610,
      "text": "有人说是千岛湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17150,
      "end_ms": 18110,
      "text": "天下第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18110,
      "end_ms": 19070,
      "text": "秀水错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19670,
      "end_ms": 21650,
      "text": "真要论起值得两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22050,
      "end_ms": 25170,
      "text": "西湖和千岛湖连前三都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 26030,
      "end_ms": 30880,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国最值得去剧的十大湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31320,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "text": "先讲第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33820,
      "end_ms": 35200,
      "text": "一个比一个绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35640,
      "end_ms": 37240,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37480,
      "end_ms": 39560,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39820,
      "end_ms": 42500,
      "text": "让我看看这湖谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 44100,
      "end_ms": 53200,
      "text": "平十名青海茶卡盐湖在青海海西州乌兰县湖面海拔三千零五十九米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 53440,
      "end_ms": 55960,
      "text": "总面积一百零五平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 56280,
      "end_ms": 60945,
      "text": "这湖最绝的是它平平的向一面镜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 61300,
      "end_ms": 63745,
      "text": "湖面上铺着一层薄薄的盐水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 64290,
      "end_ms": 65490,
      "text": "天是什么颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 65730,
      "end_ms": 67155,
      "text": "湖就是什么颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 67490,
      "end_ms": 68725,
      "text": "云是什么形状，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 69050,
      "end_ms": 70805,
      "text": "湖里就倒映什么形状。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 71190,
      "end_ms": 72545,
      "text": "人走在湖面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 72850,
      "end_ms": 74185,
      "text": "就像走在云上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 74560,
      "end_ms": 76205,
      "text": "所以叫天空之境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 76760,
      "end_ms": 78885,
      "text": "白天是天空之境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79170,
      "end_ms": 80915,
      "text": "晚上是夜空之静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 81570,
      "end_ms": 83655,
      "text": "银河倒映在湖面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 84120,
      "end_ms": 85445,
      "text": "星星在脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 86130,
      "end_ms": 89085,
      "text": "茶卡盐湖的盐挖了三千多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90140,
      "end_ms": 91565,
      "text": "早在西汉时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 92330,
      "end_ms": 94445,
      "text": "当地的羌人就在这儿采盐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 95020,
      "end_ms": 97955,
      "text": "这里的岩层最厚的地方有十几米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 98770,
      "end_ms": 101285,
      "text": "够全世界人吃上好几十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 101790,
      "end_ms": 104355,
      "text": "您坐着小火车往湖心走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 104800,
      "end_ms": 106605,
      "text": "两边全是白花花的盐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 107500,
      "end_ms": 109670,
      "text": "脚下踩的是盐水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 109670,
      "end_ms": 110705,
      "text": "里泡的是盐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111250,
      "end_ms": 113105,
      "text": "连空气里都飘着咸味儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113550,
      "end_ms": 117685,
      "text": "您说这是湖还是老天爷搁在地上的一面镜子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117900,
      "end_ms": 118495,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 118800,
      "end_ms": 122870,
      "text": "云南洱海在云南大理苍山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 123590,
      "end_ms": 125870,
      "text": "这湖最绝的不是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 126530,
      "end_ms": 128150,
      "text": "是水边那条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 128930,
      "end_ms": 132630,
      "text": "洱海生态廊道全长一百二十九公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 133330,
      "end_ms": 136330,
      "text": "一边是青瓦白墙的白族民居，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 136870,
      "end_ms": 138790,
      "text": "一边是碧蓝的湖水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 139490,
      "end_ms": 141570,
      "text": "海菜花在水面上开着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 141570,
      "end_ms": 144650,
      "text": "白花白鹭在浅滩上站着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 145410,
      "end_ms": 147650,
      "text": "您骑着自行车慢慢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 148530,
      "end_ms": 149410,
      "text": "风吹过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 149410,
      "end_ms": 151160,
      "text": "湖面闪着光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152840,
      "end_ms": 157740,
      "text": "洱海的鸟类从九十四种增加到了一百零四种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00055",
      "start_ms": 158100,
      "end_ms": 161740,
      "text": "海菜花分布面积达到约七十六万平方米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00056",
      "start_ms": 161840,
      "end_ms": 163120,
      "text": "这些树字什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163440,
      "end_ms": 166520,
      "text": "说明洱海的水越来越干净了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00058",
      "start_ms": 166760,
      "end_ms": 168560,
      "text": "洱海边上还有个古生村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00059",
      "start_ms": 169000,
      "end_ms": 170340,
      "text": "村里有棵大青树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00060",
      "start_ms": 171180,
      "end_ms": 172320,
      "text": "一千多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00061",
      "start_ms": 172600,
      "end_ms": 174120,
      "text": "树下是青石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00062",
      "start_ms": 174580,
      "end_ms": 176080,
      "text": "路边是白族老院子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00063",
      "start_ms": 176120,
      "end_ms": 177240,
      "text": "您走累了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00064",
      "start_ms": 177240,
      "end_ms": 182925,
      "text": "往湖边一坐村苍边上十九封看洱海万顷波，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00065",
      "start_ms": 183370,
      "end_ms": 185155,
      "text": "看天上的云慢慢走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00066",
      "start_ms": 185520,
      "end_ms": 187780,
      "text": "您说这是湖还是大自然？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00067",
      "start_ms": 187780,
      "end_ms": 189695,
      "text": "给人类发的一张成绩单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00068",
      "start_ms": 190090,
      "end_ms": 190775,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00069",
      "start_ms": 191110,
      "end_ms": 196230,
      "text": "浙江千岛湖在浙江杭州淳安这壶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00070",
      "start_ms": 196270,
      "end_ms": 199835,
      "text": "最绝的是他水底下压着两座古城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00071",
      "start_ms": 200420,
      "end_ms": 201545,
      "text": "一九五九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00072",
      "start_ms": 201880,
      "end_ms": 208405,
      "text": "新安江水电站蓄水狮城和鹤城两座千年古城沉到了水底下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00073",
      "start_ms": 209150,
      "end_ms": 210465,
      "text": "千岛湖的水质，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00074",
      "start_ms": 210910,
      "end_ms": 213615,
      "text": "常年保持地表水一类标准，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00075",
      "start_ms": 214210,
      "end_ms": 215875,
      "text": "能见度七米以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00076",
      "start_ms": 216750,
      "end_ms": 219585,
      "text": "湖面上有一千零七十八座岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00077",
      "start_ms": 220000,
      "end_ms": 222775,
      "text": "每一座岛都是原来的一座山头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00078",
      "start_ms": 223630,
      "end_ms": 226840,
      "text": "您坐船在湖上走底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00079",
      "start_ms": 227130,
      "end_ms": 229565,
      "text": "就是一座沉在水底的古城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00080",
      "start_ms": 230150,
      "end_ms": 233150,
      "text": "千岛湖底下那两座城城墙还在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00081",
      "start_ms": 233190,
      "end_ms": 240315,
      "text": "牌坊还在民房还在连城门口的石狮子都还蹲在那儿水下考古队下去看过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00082",
      "start_ms": 240690,
      "end_ms": 243025,
      "text": "说保存的比预想的好得多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00083",
      "start_ms": 243790,
      "end_ms": 244790,
      "text": "因为水温低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00084",
      "start_ms": 245030,
      "end_ms": 245725,
      "text": "水流慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00085",
      "start_ms": 246070,
      "end_ms": 247485,
      "text": "木头、石头都没怎么烂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00086",
      "start_ms": 247900,
      "end_ms": 252025,
      "text": "您说这是湖还是一座泡在水里的博物馆？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00087",
      "start_ms": 252450,
      "end_ms": 253145,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00088",
      "start_ms": 253550,
      "end_ms": 261885,
      "text": "云南抚仙湖在云南玉溪澄江这壶醉绝的是他身平均深度九十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00089",
      "start_ms": 262240,
      "end_ms": 264015,
      "text": "最深处一百五十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00090",
      "start_ms": 264590,
      "end_ms": 267275,
      "text": "蓄水量两百零六亿立方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00091",
      "start_ms": 268010,
      "end_ms": 272185,
      "text": "占云南全省湖泊蓄水总量的六成以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00092",
      "start_ms": 272610,
      "end_ms": 273285,
      "text": "什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00093",
      "start_ms": 273520,
      "end_ms": 276865,
      "text": "滇池和洱海加起来还不到他的一半。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00094",
      "start_ms": 277670,
      "end_ms": 278895,
      "text": "更邪乎的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00095",
      "start_ms": 279240,
      "end_ms": 281905,
      "text": "湖底下发现了一座古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00096",
      "start_ms": 282390,
      "end_ms": 283475,
      "text": "有石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00097",
      "start_ms": 283830,
      "end_ms": 285015,
      "text": "有建筑机制。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00098",
      "start_ms": 285850,
      "end_ms": 288325,
      "text": "有人说是古滇国的都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00099",
      "start_ms": 288850,
      "end_ms": 292135,
      "text": "到现在没人能说清他是什么时候沉下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00100",
      "start_ms": 293290,
      "end_ms": 296590,
      "text": "抚仙湖的水清的能看见水底的石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00101",
      "start_ms": 297450,
      "end_ms": 302270,
      "text": "古人管它叫琉璃万顷抚仙湖还有个奇怪的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00102",
      "start_ms": 302610,
      "end_ms": 304970,
      "text": "湖里捞上来过不少青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00103",
      "start_ms": 305310,
      "end_ms": 306110,
      "text": "有铜鼓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00104",
      "start_ms": 306330,
      "end_ms": 306810,
      "text": "有铜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00105",
      "start_ms": 306830,
      "end_ms": 307970,
      "text": "釜有铜毛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00106",
      "start_ms": 308670,
      "end_ms": 311490,
      "text": "跟中原的青铜器长得完全不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00107",
      "start_ms": 311490,
      "end_ms": 314890,
      "text": "跟古滇国的青铜器倒是像一家人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00108",
      "start_ms": 315310,
      "end_ms": 316210,
      "text": "您说这是壶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00109",
      "start_ms": 316730,
      "end_ms": 318850,
      "text": "还是一个藏着秘密的深渊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00110",
      "start_ms": 320230,
      "end_ms": 320890,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00111",
      "start_ms": 321210,
      "end_ms": 327110,
      "text": "新疆塞里木湖在新疆博尔塔拉天山山脉西段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00112",
      "start_ms": 327530,
      "end_ms": 329990,
      "text": "湖面海拔两千零七十一米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00113",
      "start_ms": 330130,
      "end_ms": 334290,
      "text": "是新疆海拔最高、面积最大的高山湖泊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00114",
      "start_ms": 335010,
      "end_ms": 341530,
      "text": "这湖最绝的是它的蓝大西洋的暖石气流从欧洲出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00115",
      "start_ms": 341850,
      "end_ms": 343450,
      "text": "走了六千多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00116",
      "start_ms": 343890,
      "end_ms": 344830,
      "text": "翻过天山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00117",
      "start_ms": 345230,
      "end_ms": 349550,
      "text": "最后在塞里木湖上空化作一场雨落了下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00118",
      "start_ms": 349650,
      "end_ms": 352215,
      "text": "所以叫大西洋最后一滴眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00119",
      "start_ms": 352900,
      "end_ms": 355475,
      "text": "赛里木湖最大水深超过九十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00120",
      "start_ms": 356070,
      "end_ms": 357735,
      "text": "透明度高达十二米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00121",
      "start_ms": 358240,
      "end_ms": 359395,
      "text": "阳光照进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00122",
      "start_ms": 359730,
      "end_ms": 361235,
      "text": "湖水把阳光拆开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00123",
      "start_ms": 361610,
      "end_ms": 364875,
      "text": "只把最难的那一层流在水面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00124",
      "start_ms": 365150,
      "end_ms": 366290,
      "text": "您站在湖边看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00125",
      "start_ms": 366510,
      "end_ms": 367745,
      "text": "蓝的不像真的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00126",
      "start_ms": 368180,
      "end_ms": 370455,
      "text": "赛里木湖的兰不是一种难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00127",
      "start_ms": 370870,
      "end_ms": 372405,
      "text": "早上是浅浅的蓝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00128",
      "start_ms": 372690,
      "end_ms": 374015,
      "text": "中午是深深的懒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00129",
      "start_ms": 374400,
      "end_ms": 375875,
      "text": "傍晚是带紫的蓝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00130",
      "start_ms": 376390,
      "end_ms": 378515,
      "text": "当地人管他叫赛里木兰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00131",
      "start_ms": 379070,
      "end_ms": 380855,
      "text": "全世界找不出第二个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00132",
      "start_ms": 381340,
      "end_ms": 383870,
      "text": "您说这是湖还是大西洋？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00133",
      "start_ms": 383890,
      "end_ms": 384750,
      "text": "哭了一滴泪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00134",
      "start_ms": 384870,
      "end_ms": 386795,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00135",
      "start_ms": 387800,
      "end_ms": 390195,
      "text": "茶卡盐湖是一面镜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00136",
      "start_ms": 390700,
      "end_ms": 392655,
      "text": "洱海是一张成绩单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00137",
      "start_ms": 393130,
      "end_ms": 396185,
      "text": "千岛湖是一座泡在水里的博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00138",
      "start_ms": 396800,
      "end_ms": 399915,
      "text": "抚仙湖是一个藏着秘密的深渊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00139",
      "start_ms": 400480,
      "end_ms": 403015,
      "text": "赛里木湖是大西洋的一滴眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00140",
      "start_ms": 403410,
      "end_ms": 406295,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最值得去的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00141",
      "start_ms": 406700,
      "end_ms": 408395,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00142",
      "start_ms": 408690,
      "end_ms": 409545,
      "text": "一个比一个狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00143",
      "start_ms": 410040,
      "end_ms": 415705,
      "text": "有一个湖会变好几种颜色有一个湖养活了一整个高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00144",
      "start_ms": 416080,
      "end_ms": 416875,
      "text": "他是哪个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00145",
      "start_ms": 417620,
      "end_ms": 418885,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00146",
      "start_ms": 419140,
      "end_ms": 420215,
      "text": "下季马上更新。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_50948fbc811aec3b_s00147",
      "start_ms": 420720,
      "end_ms": 425225,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
